<title>HONG KONG: Beiren Printing 1996 net down 19.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Beiren Printing 1996 net down 19.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (yuan)		   0.183  vs 0.228</p>
<p>    Dividend (yuan)	    0.075  vs 0.06</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
